:: Fishing Forest Lake Boar Attack
<<effects>>
<<beastNEWinit 1 boar>>
<<if $settings.bestialityEnabled>>
	<<set $fishingBoarMouthTarget to random(1, 3)>>
	A crash erupts from the undergrowth as a <<beasttype>> bursts from the treeline, tusks flashing. <<bHe>> charges straight at
	<<if $fishingBoarMouthTarget is 1>>
		you, <span class="red"><<bhis>> jaws closing into your neck</span> before you can react
	<<elseif $fishingBoarMouthTarget is 2>>
		you, <span class="red"><<bhis>> jaws clenching your hair</span> before you can react
	<<else>>
		you.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Fight|Fishing Forest Lake Boar Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	A crashing erupts from the undergrowth as a <<beasttype>> bursts from the treeline, charging at you. You manage to fend it off<<if !fishingUsingMagnetRod()>>, batting it away with your fishing rod,<<else>><</if>> but you don't escape unscathed.<<beastescape>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Boar Molestation
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<run stopFishingProp()>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<beastCombatInit>>
	<<if $fishingBoarMouthTarget is 1>>
		<<set $NPCList[0].mouth to "neck">>
		<<set $head to "grappled">>
	<<elseif $fishingBoarMouthTarget is 2>>
		<<set $NPCList[0].mouth to "hair">>
		<<set $head to "grappled">>
	<</if>>
	<<unset $fishingBoarMouthTarget>>
	<<forestRescueSetup>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<forestRescueCheck>>
<br><br>

<<beast $enemyno>>
<br><br>

<<stateman>>
<br><br>

<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Forest Lake Boar Molestation Finish]]>><</link>></span>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Forest Lake Boar Molestation]]>><</link>></span>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Boar Molestation Finish
<<effects>>
<<set $fishing.fishingForestLake.event to "none">>
<<set $fishing.fishingForestLake.eventDanger to 0>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>
	The <<beasttype>> snorts loudly and retreats back into the forest.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you rise to your feet.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Lake Fishing Rock]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	The <<beasttype>> turns and runs, crashing through the undergrowth in <<bhis>> haste to escape.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Lake Fishing Rock]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<<elseif $rescue is 1 and $alarm is 1>>
	<<forestRescue>>
<</if>>


:: Widgets Fishing Forest Lake Boar [widget]
/* Text that can appear while waiting if a boar will attack soon */
<<widget "fishingForestLakeBoarAttackWaitAmbient">>
	<<addinlineevent 20>>
		<<print either(
			"The musty smell of wet fur drifts on the breeze.",
			"You hear heavy footfalls beyond the treeline.",
			"Branches snap in the forest behind you.",
			"You feel like something is watching you.",
			"You hear snuffling coming from the treeline."
		)>>
		<<set $fishing.fishingForestLake.eventDanger += 1>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</widget>>
